and I just blew it.

8
00:00:21,471 --> 00:00:22,611
(Emily:)Don't worry about it.

9
00:00:23,439 --> 00:00:24,979
(Emily:)And if it makes you feel any better,

10
00:00:25,141 --> 00:00:27,451
(Emily:)you're not the weirdest guy
