11
00:00:27,610 --> 00:00:31,110
(Raj:)Well, give me a chance,
you don't even know me.

12
00:00:33,483 --> 00:00:36,293
(Emily:)All right, here's your chance.

13
00:00:36,752 --> 00:00:38,492
What? Really?

14
00:00:39,589 --> 00:00:40,729
(Raj:)Thank you.

15
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,340
(Raj:)Fate has given me
a rare second chance,

16
00:00:42,492 --> 00:00:44,302
(Raj:)and I swear to Vishnu
I'm not gonna blow it.

17
